{"siren:A city promises a carbon-neutral festival through offsets. Organisers regard compensation as equivalent to prevention; critics accept that offsets may fund useful projects but reject that equivalence. Neither side disputes the value of measuring emissions.":"35646149d394e262d70299f720b83805ec0c517094527bd5ce1b1c9887d37785","lauren:My friend in New Zealand told me to bring my togs, so I packed my swimwear.":"95131ab2a6987d5c7ce73c62c94c7a4ce15677100c105795fa2f847b3f748dc1","lauren:She handed my passport to the agent.":"03ed31db6273a81f38151ef77a61aaebccc4a65ff6e9bda4129fa66c4f21bd45","lauren:He left his luggage at the gate.":"0bc340b0b9b3bf0a606abfe262083253a859daf0f2a059cd132a196757fa3512","lauren:Would you mind waiting while I check the address?":"8481b79371e122aef0cc3732fd1c74abc4c94d2c5fbb86a7cdd0491f24a31a81","lauren:We should call my grandmother this weekend.":"e04335fcd716817fe58d966250ccf5b943bbe1bfb0685d90c9b018eb7feaad44","lauren:He gave me good advice.":"e0d154f90d23059538e4a4e29ece32804d554837dbb80e815140c570a7de4dc3","lauren:I will not give up, I will not back down, I will not be silenced.":"b00af34ff4e470c2d253db1b25d6b497c47ae26d9beafa0e89c5c48bad65b9e8","lauren:Granted, the proposal has some flaws, yet its innovative approach could disrupt the industry if refined.":"095d40756e59b8db8b2b7d989af85fe143c5f6bbf7940a4b29297b123fa232eb"}